## Summary
SeoulTech and KBIOHealth have signed a research cooperation agreement focusing on quantum technology and advanced bio-health. The partnership aims to promote joint research and innovation in these cutting-edge fields, with potential implications for medical advancements.

## Key Points
- SeoulTech and KBIOHealth signed a research cooperation agreement.
- The agreement specifically covers quantum technology and advanced bio-health.
- This collaboration seeks to advance research in emerging medical and technological areas.


